[00:15.70] You made the tears of love
[00:22.24] Flow like they did when I saw
[00:28.14] The dying swan
[00:34.70] The swan that died in darkness
[00:44.60] I want your smile
[00:50.48] I dreamt of your swan smile
[00:58.98] And then wings moved the air
[01:08.28] Water rings widened
[01:14.54] As bells sounded
[01:23.12] In the night
[01:31.68] Then your smile died
[01:39.36] On the water
[01:46.10] It was only a reflection
[01:54.60] Dying with the swan
